<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Beane et al. (2011) planarian H,K-ATPase bioelectric V_mem anterior polarity switch (Schmidtea mediterranea freshwater planarian flatworm)",
        "Beane et al. (2011) planarian H,K-ATPase bioelectric V_mem anterior polarity switch faithfully reproduces Schmidtea mediterranea freshwater planarian flatworm morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2011-beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Schmidtea mediterranea freshwater planarian flatworm specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 91.1/100, audit 2026-10-19-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2011-beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior.py> ;
    schema:about "Schmidtea mediterranea freshwater planarian flatworm" ;
    schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: Single-cell stochastic neoblast migration trajectories or full 3D muscle-fiber extracellular matrix remodeling during blastema outgrowth",
        "reconstructed_in_script: 1D coupled bistable V_mem + Bell-form voltage-gated gap-junction PDE and mutually antagonistic Head H(x,t) / Tail T(x,t) morphogen cascade across 5 experimental regimes",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Automated dorsal body-contour and bilateral photoreceptor ocelli segmentation on schmidtea_mediterranea_specimen.jpg (N=2 eyespots at x/L=0.0528, length=1478 px) and 2D body-plan silhouette synthesis",
        "reported_in_source: Beane et al. (2011) Chem. Biol. 18:77-89 H,K-ATPase-mediated anterior blastema membrane depolarization (V_mem) and L-type Ca2+ channel requirement for head regeneration in Schmidtea mediterranea (1H1T wild-type, 0H2T SCH-28080/RNAi headless, 2H0T ivermectin double-head)",
        "reported_in_source: Oviedo et al. (2010) Dev. Biol. 339:188-199 & Pietak-Levin (2017) J. R. Soc. Interface 14:20170425 voltage-gated innexin gap-junction coupling G_GJ(DeltaV) and 8-octanol double-head (2H0T) induction",
        "transfer_boundary: 1D anteroposterior bioelectric V_mem and morphogen profiles mapped onto 2D dorsal Schmidtea mediterranea body-plan silhouettes and eyespot coordinates" ;
