d morphogen profiles mapped onto 2D dorsal Schmidtea mediterranea body-plan silhouettes and eyespot coordinates; does_not_claim: Single-cell stochastic neoblast migration trajectories or full 3D muscle-fiber extracellular matrix remodeling during blastema outgrowth]" ;
