<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Beane et al. (2011) planarian H,K-ATPase bioelectric V_mem anterior polarity switch — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Faithfully implements the coupled Beane et al. (2011) and Pietak-Levin (2017) bistable membrane voltage PDE, symmetric Bell-form voltage-gated gap-junction flux divergence (10x conductance isolation at 36 mV trans-junctional drop), voltage-gated L-type Ca2+ influx gate Ca_ss(V), and mutually antagonistic anterior Head H(x,t) (*pc2/ndk*) and posterior Tail T(x,t) (*wnt1*) reaction-diffusion equations (L118-378), verified by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys) in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_081_planarian_hk_atpase_anterior.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
