        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Beane et al. (2011) planarian H,K-ATPase bioelectric V_mem anterior polarity switch — Morphometric validation: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Extracts 6 reference-anchored quantitative morphometric measurements via `measure_morphoeval()` (L715-815): wild-type AP V_mem polarization delta (+50.52 mV vs +45.0 mV reference), H,K-ATPase inhibition anterior head commitment suppression delta (0.9168 vs 0.90 reference), ivermectin & 8-octanol double-head induction count (2 heads vs 2 reference), segmented specimen bilateral ocelli relative AP position (0.0528 vs 0.065 reference, std = 0.0036), specimen vs simulated 1H1T width profile correlation (Pearson r and RMSE across 60 AP bins), and 5-regime regenerated head count RMSE = 0.0000 (exact 5/5 phenotype match)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
